  "ruleText": "Den 101.32 “Temporary dental restoration” means a substance placed as an interim restoration to sedate or seal a tooth.\n\nSource. #8099, eff 6-11-04; renumbered by #12427 (formerly Den 101.24); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.28)",
